<title>AUSTRALIA: Cricket-Sheffield Shield result.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Sheffield Shield result.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result on the final day of a four-day Sheffield Shield cricket match on Monday:</p>
<p>South Australia beat Queensland by nine wickets. South Australia 527-6 declared (Darren Lehmann 255) and 51 for one; Queensland 227 (Wade Seccombe 59) and 350 (Geoff Foley 72, Matthew Hayden 69).</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
